| Library | Size | What it did | 
|---|---|---|
| chroma-js | ~14 kB | Color parsing, luminance calc, readable color selection | 
| polished | ~11 kB | readableColor()for styled-components | 
| tinycolor2 | ~5 kB | Hex parsing, WCAG contrast ratio math | 
